warning[R0703] (conservative): array items mixed with keyed fields
--> 15:2: 2 positional item(s) alongside 1 keyed field(s)
  = note: a table that is both an array and a map trips length (`#`), iteration order, and JSON encoding; split it into an array field and named fields
  = note: valid Luau, and occasionally deliberate (an options table with a positional payload) — Rime cannot tell

error[R0012] (conservative): duplicate key `2` in table constructor
--> 17:3: `2` assigned again here
    16:2: positional item 2 fills this slot first
  = note: the last value silently wins; the earlier entry is discarded before the table exists
  = help: remove the `[2]` key or the positional item, or assign the slot after construction if the overwrite is deliberate

error[R0012] (conservative): duplicate key `16` in table constructor
--> 24:3: `16` assigned again here
